{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜跨境白牌車問題(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-03-13-49-51HVjNsm1e.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：跨境白牌車問題</p><p>本台早前揭發有「白牌車」接載內地旅客離港，警方連日發起打擊及拘捕行動。究竟跨境「白牌車」為何禁之不絕？怎樣才是長遠的治本方案？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>中港澳直通巴士聯會秘書長李少鳴</p><p>中國香港汽車會永遠榮譽會長李耀培</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:34.760429+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:04.405582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:52.549521+00:00","content_hash":"2547488c7509bc33016820b5cfcc7a790642e0237402a798d805f2dc3783a50c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}